          "type": "singleCorrect",
          "level": 1,
          "question": {
            "text": "Minimise $Z=\\sum_{j=1}^{n} \\sum_{i=1}^{m} c_{i j} x_{i j}$\r\n\r\nSubject to $\\sum_{i=1}^{m} x_{i j}=b_{j}, j=1,2, \\ldots, n$\r\n\r\n$\\sum_{j=1}^{n} x_{i j}=b_{j}, i=1,2, \\ldots, m$ is a $L P P$ with number of constr",
            "image": null
          },
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "A9vS2",
              "text": "$m-n$",
              "isCorrect": false,
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "eA4bk",
              "text": "$m$",
              "isCorrect": false,
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "ux6QN",
              "text": "$\\mathrm{m}+\\mathrm{n}$",
              "isCorrect": true,
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "T20T6",
              "text": "$\\frac{\\mathrm{m}}{\\mathrm{n}}$",
              "isCorrect": false,
              "image": null
            }
          ],
          "correctValue": null,
          "solution": {
            "text": "Constraints will be\r\n\r\n$$\r\n\r\n\\mathrm{x}_{11}+\\mathrm{x}_{21}+\\ldots .+\\mathrm{x}_{\\mathrm{ml}}=\\mathrm{b}_{1}\r\n\r\n$$\r\n\r\n$\\mathrm{x}_{12}+\\mathrm{x}_{22}+\\ldots \\ldots \\mathrm{x}_{\\mathrm{m} 2}=\\mathrm{b}_{2}$\r\n\r\n$\\mathrm{x}_{\\ln }+\\mathrm{x}_{2 \\mathrm{n}}+\\ldots .+\\mathrm{x}_{\\mathrm{mn}}=\\mathrm{b}_{\\mathrm{n}}$\r\n\r\n$\\mathrm{x}_{11}+\\mathrm{x}_{12}+\\ldots+\\mathrm{x}_{1 \\mathrm{n}}=\\mathrm{b}_{1}$\r\n\r\n$\\mathrm{x}_{21}+\\mathrm{x}_{22}+\\ldots+\\mathrm{x}_{2 \\mathrm{n}}=\\mathrm{b}_{2}$\r\n\r\n$\\mathrm{x}_{\\mathrm{ml}}+\\mathrm{x}_{\\mathrm{m} 2}+\\ldots+\\mathrm{x}_{\\mathrm{mn}}=\\mathrm{b}_{\\mathrm{n}}$\r\n\r\nSo, total number of constraints $=\\mathrm{m}+\\mathrm{n}$",
            "image": null
          },
